{{!-- Shared capacity bar (bead 7dt0): ONE anatomy for used-vs-capacity
     meters on the starship Hull tab (stat-grid) and the Refit tab (budget
     strip). Reuses the encumbrance bar precedent (fill + over state).
     Hash: label (localized, passed by the caller), used, total (numbers),
     pct (0-100 fill width, computed in the sheet context), over (boolean —
     alarm colour when used exceeds capacity). An optional @partial-block
     renders after the numbers (Hull tab: editable total input). --}}
<div class="capacity-bar{{#if over}} over{{/if}}">
    <span class="cb-label">{{label}}</span>
    <span class="cb-track" data-tooltip="{{label}}: {{used}}/{{total}}">
        <span class="cb-fill" style="width: {{pct}}%"></span>
    </span>
    <span class="cb-value">{{used}}/{{total}}</span>
    {{!-- Guarded block: the Refit budget strip invokes this partial WITHOUT
         a block (only the Hull tab passes the editable-total block). A bare
         {{> @partial-block}} with no block throws at render time. --}}
    {{#if @partial-block}}{{> @partial-block}}{{/if}}
</div>